{%- comment -%}
  KUN-COM-UX-CLAIM-001 (replaces the KUN-RC-COM-001B paragraph). For Settings > Notifications > Customer
  notifications > Order confirmation on the QA store only: paste it just after the order summary heading.
  Shown only when the order contains the Janam Kundali SKU. The link is the claim page with the order number in the
  URL fragment (#order=...), which browsers never send to a server; it carries NO e-mail address, birth detail,
  token or secret. The buyer still types the checkout e-mail and receives a one-time code.
  The Thank you and Order status pages use the kundali-claim-link app extension (extensions/kundali-claim).
  English copy, with one Hindi line, is draft copy for ChatGPT English/Hindi content QA and owner approval.
  REPLACE-commerce-staging-host and REPLACE-SBK-ESS-EN-1 are set per store (QA values in the QA handoff).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign has_kundali = false -%}
{%- for line in line_items -%}
  {%- if line.sku == "REPLACE-SBK-ESS-EN-1" -%}{%- assign has_kundali = true -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- if has_kundali -%}
<table class="row" style="width:100%;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse;margin:24px 0;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:20px;border:1px solid #E9DDCF;border-left:4px solid #F4B400;border-radius:10px;background:#FFF8E7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E211D;">
      <h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#33241F;">Prepare your Janam Kundali</h2>
      <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">Your Janam Kundali Essentials report (in English) is
        ready to prepare. Open the Kundali page, confirm order {{ order_name }} with a one-time code sent to this
        e-mail address, then enter your birth date, exact birth time and birthplace to download your PDF.</p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;" lang="hi">यह रिपोर्ट केवल अंग्रेज़ी में है।</p>
      <table style="border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse;">
        <tr>
          <td style="border-radius:10px;background:#C84700;">
            <a href="https://REPLACE-commerce-staging-host/#order={{ order_number }}"
               style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;">Prepare your Janam Kundali</a>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
      <p style="margin:16px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#75655E;">Please prepare it within 30 days of
        your order. After your first download you can prepare up to 3 corrected versions within 30 days. Your birth
        details are used once to prepare the PDF and are not stored. You can also open the Kundali page later from
        your order status page.</p>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
{%- endif -%}
